# LINKCLOUD — ADVANCED PRIVATE DATA ENCRYPTION &amp; WEBMASTER-ONLY ACCESS SECURITY ADDENDUM
 
## CRITICAL SECURITY AUTHORITY
 
This addendum supplements the existing LinkCloud Master Production Implementation Prompt.
 
All requirements in this addendum are mandatory.
 
The existing authenticated, active and authorized `webmaster` account must remain the ONLY privileged website management authority.
 
