## 1. PRIVATE DATA INVISIBILITY
 
Implement strict private-data isolation throughout the entire application.
 
Public visitors and ordinary registered users must not be able to discover, view, download, query or retrieve another user's private information.
 
Protect:
 
- Full name and private profile details.
- Personal email addresses.
- Verified mobile numbers.
- Date of birth.
- Residential addresses.
- Private profile photographs.
- Authentication and verification records.
- Private account information.
- Internal complaints.
- Reporter identities.
